WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.187
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> This is Stressed Sally.

2
00:00:08.424 --> 00:00:15.176
She’s an administrator in a busy office. She works long hours.

3
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:18.346
This is Sally’s daily routine.

4
00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:26.008
Sally wakes up at seven o’clock.

5
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.840
She has a shower.

6
00:00:33.047 --> 00:00:34.869
She gets dressed.

7
00:00:38.001 --> 00:00:39.811
She puts on make-up.

8
00:00:43.106 --> 00:00:44.703
She has a coffee.

9
00:00:47.861 --> 00:00:50.818
Sally goes to work by bus.

10
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:56.834
She gets to work at 8.25.

11
00:00:58.107 --> 00:01:01.389
She starts work at 8.30.

12
00:01:03.348 --> 00:01:05.245
She has lunch at work.

13
00:01:08.328 --> 00:01:11.722
She finishes work at 6.30.

14
00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:15.379
Sally goes shopping.

15
00:01:18.212 --> 00:01:20.308
She gets home late.

16
00:01:23.641 --> 00:01:25.650
She does the housework.

17
00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:30.342
She has pizza for dinner.

18
00:01:32.963 --> 00:01:35.122
She checks emails.

19
00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:40.089
Sally goes to bed.

20
00:01:48.176 --> 00:01:50.647
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> This is Relaxed Robbie.

21
00:01:51.371 --> 00:01:56.425
He’s a gardener. He works for people in their gardens.

22
00:01:56.987 --> 00:01:59.783
This is Robbie’s daily routine.

23
00:02:03.452 --> 00:02:06.497
Robbie gets up at eight o’clock.

24
00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:12.974
He has a shave.

25
00:02:19.488 --> 00:02:21.548
He takes the dog for a walk.

26
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.460
He has breakfast.

27
00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:37.921
Robbie walks to work.

28
00:02:42.838 --> 00:02:44.985
He goes home early.

29
00:02:50.251 --> 00:02:53.346
He goes to his Italian class.

30
00:02:58.788 --> 00:03:00.909
He sees friends.

31
00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.896
Robbie makes dinner.

32
00:03:15.136 --> 00:03:17.932
He relaxes on the sofa.

33
00:03:22.674 --> 00:03:25.270
He has a bath.

34
00:03:31.061 --> 00:03:34.555
He sleeps for eight hours.